1 0 0 1 50 648 Tm (That works only when both frontend and backend are served from the same origin. In) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 632 Tm (development, I solved this by configuring a Vite proxy so all /api requests were) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 616 Tm (forwarded to http://127.0.0.1:8000.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 600 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 584 Tm (Result:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 568 Tm (This fixed local development communication without requiring hardcoded backend URLs in) Tj
